<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58482" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιτών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶνος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bed-chamber</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				120.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				11.69
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐπὶ τοῦ κοιτῶνος</span>”
				<i>chamberlain,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Act.Ap.
					12.20
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.22.15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ κ. Σεβαστοῦ</span>,
				= Lat. <i>cubicularius Augusti</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2947
			</span></i> (Caria, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.2143
			</span></i>, al.: rejected by the Atticists, who hold <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δωμάτιον</span> to be correct, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				227
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>grave,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				14.464
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Catana</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>nursery</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν κ. εἶναι</span> to
			be an infant, minor, <i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				155
			</span></i>
            <u>Praef.</u>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>landing-place,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Stad.
				128
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
